WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,900
It seems that the death threats have finally forced some people to unite in private for warmth.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:08,000
Chen Zhenghao is simply a devil. He robbed three families in a row and still couldn't beat two of them!

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
We must unite. With so many people swarming up, I can knock him down with just one kick!

4
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,640
When will we take action?

5
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:23,640
The other party is a disciple of the king, and being reckless is the behavior of a fierce man. If we want to win with wisdom, we need to remember it from time to time!

6
00:00:25,090 --> 00:00:30,590
It's just that I have been hiding in my mouth. Just now I threatened to knock the opponent down with one kick. If I really want to take action, I will change my words and rely on my wisdom.

7
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:31,590
How ridiculous

8
00:00:31,590 --> 00:00:36,620
I am willing to take the lead, but I need at least a dozen young men to act together to be sure.

9
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:40,390
We women are weak, men show their responsibility

10
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:44,060
Dear men, you must protect us weak women

11
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:50,060
Normally, ladies are given priority, but in critical moments, men are left to fight. Why should they get together!
